{"seq":1,"slug":"stylus-keyboard-pointer-input-model","title":"多模态输入模型：手写笔、外接键盘、鼠标与触控的焦点、hover 与快捷键","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/multi-input-testing-store-quality-ops/stylus-keyboard-pointer-input-model","wordCount":2101,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"多模态输入模型-手写笔-外接键盘-鼠标与触控的焦点-hover-与快捷键\">多模态输入模型：手写笔、外接键盘、鼠标与触控的焦点、hover 与快捷键</h1><p>大屏与折叠屏设备最容易被低估的变化，是「输入源从单点变成集合」。一台 13 英寸平板可能同时接着蓝牙键盘、触控板，屏幕上还横着一支压感手写笔，用户随手在手指、笔、鼠标之间切换——而同一份商品详情页要在这三种输入下都能完成「加入购物车 → 改数量 → 结算」。Android 平板/折叠屏质量分级把这件事写成硬指标：Tier 3「Adaptive ready」要求基础支持键盘、鼠标、触控板和手写笔，Tier 2 要求增强支持，Tier 1 才谈针对手写笔和拖放的差异化体验（<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/docs/quality-guidelines/tablet-app-quality\">Android tablet app quality</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-输入源是-能力集-不是-设备型号\">核心概念：输入源是「能力集」，不是「设备型号」</h2><p>把输入硬编码成设备类型——「平板 = 触摸、笔记本 = 鼠标」——大屏上必然出错。正确的抽象有两层：每个输入源暴露一组<strong>能力</strong>（能否 hover、指针精度是 fine 还是 coarse、有没有压力与倾斜）；每个<strong>事件</strong>携带真实来源。W3C Pointer Events Level 3（W3C Recommendation，2026-06-30）把来源暴露为 <code>PointerEvent.pointerType</code>，取值为 <code>&quot;mouse&quot;</code> / <code>&quot;pen&quot;</code> / <code>&quot;touch&quot;</code>，无法判定时为空串（<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/pointerevents3/\">W3C Pointer Events L3</a>）。CSS 侧用两组媒体特性描述能力：<code>pointer</code>/<code>hover</code> 描述<strong>主</strong>输入源，<code>any-pointer</code>/<code>any-hover</code> 描述<strong>任意可用</strong>输入源（<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@media/any-pointer\">MDN any-pointer</a>）。四者都描述能力，不是设备身份。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入源</th>\n<th>典型 <code>pointer</code></th>\n<th>典型 <code>hover</code></th>\n<th>大屏上的工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手指触控</td>\n<td><code>coarse</code></td>\n<td><code>none</code></td>\n<td>命中区要够大，关键操作不能藏在 hover 后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鼠标 / 触控板</td>\n<td><code>fine</code></td>\n<td><code>hover</code></td>\n<td>可用 hover 展开二级菜单、密度可提高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动式手写笔</td>\n<td>常为 <code>fine</code></td>\n<td>取决于笔与数字转换器</td>\n<td>可做压感笔迹；hover 只在部分硬件可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被动式电容笔</td>\n<td><code>coarse</code></td>\n<td><code>none</code></td>\n<td>与手指无法区分，等价触控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键陷阱：<strong>CSS 无法把笔和鼠标区分开</strong>。支持 hover 的笔与鼠标都会命中 <code>(hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)</code>；<code>any-hover: hover</code> 在触屏平板上也可能因为接了一支笔而变真（<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@media/hover\">MDN hover</a>）。要区分真实笔输入只能在事件里读 <code>pointerType === &quot;pen&quot;</code>，而它仅在该事件发生的那一刻可知，无法提前盘点设备。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[物理输入源] --&gt; B{事件来源}&#10;    B --&gt;|手指/电容笔| C[touch&lt;br/&gt;coarse · 无 hover]&#10;    B --&gt;|鼠标/触控板| D[mouse&lt;br/&gt;fine · 有 hover]&#10;    B --&gt;|主动式笔| E[pen&lt;br/&gt;fine · hover 视硬件]&#10;    C --&gt; F[归一化为交互语义]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[焦点 / hover / 快捷键 三条通道]&#10;    G --&gt; H[同一功能,三套可达路径]\">flowchart TD\n    A[物理输入源] --&gt; B{事件来源}\n    B --&gt;|手指/电容笔| C[touch&lt;br/&gt;coarse · 无 hover]\n    B --&gt;|鼠标/触控板| D[mouse&lt;br/&gt;fine · 有 hover]\n    B --&gt;|主动式笔| E[pen&lt;br/&gt;fine · hover 视硬件]\n    C --&gt; F[归一化为交互语义]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[焦点 / hover / 快捷键 三条通道]\n    G --&gt; H[同一功能,三套可达路径]</pre><p>工程落点：同一功能必须有三条可达路径——触摸点得中、键盘焦点走得到、hover 能预览到。缺一条，大屏用户就会碰到「功能在，但我的输入方式够不着」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"手写笔-工具类型-轴数据与-hover-距离\">手写笔：工具类型、轴数据与 hover 距离</h2><p>Android 侧的笔全部从 <code>MotionEvent</code> 读出：<code>event.getToolType(pointerIndex)</code> 与 <code>MotionEvent.TOOL_TYPE_STYLUS</code>、<code>TOOL_TYPE_ERASER</code> 比较即可区分笔与橡皮端（<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/touch-and-input/stylus-input/advanced-stylus-features\">Advanced stylus features</a>）。各轴含义：<code>AXIS_PRESSURE</code> 压力（正常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>…</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\dots1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，屏幕校准可能返回大于 1，需截断）、<code>AXIS_ORIENTATION</code> 朝向（弧度）、<code>AXIS_TILT</code> 倾斜（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 垂直于屏，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 平贴屏面）、<code>AXIS_DISTANCE</code> 笔距屏距离（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 为接触，<strong>悬停范围依赖厂商，不可用于关键逻辑</strong>）。压力归一化标准做法是截断到 1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>norm</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>force</mtext></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>maximumPossibleForce</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{norm}} = \\min\\left(1,\\ \\frac{F_{\\text{force}}}{F_{\\text{max}}}\\right),\\quad F_{\\text{max}} = \\text{maximumPossibleForce}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">norm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">force</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">maximumPossibleForce</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>iOS 语义同构、命名不同：<code>UITouch.type</code> 为 <code>.pencil</code>（iOS 9.1 起）表示 Apple Pencil，<code>.indirectPointer</code>（iOS 13.4 起）表示鼠标/触控板这类间接指针；<code>altitudeAngle</code>、<code>azimuthAngle(in:)</code>（均 iOS 9.1）给出倾斜与朝向，<code>force</code> / <code>maximumPossibleForce</code>（iOS 9）给出压力（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uitouch\">Apple UITouch</a>）。<strong>悬停不走 touch 通道</strong>：Apple Pencil hover 由 <code>UIHoverGestureRecognizer</code> 承担，<code>zOffset</code>（iOS 16.1 起）表示离屏距离，0 为接触，硬件上限约 <strong>12 mm（约 34 points）</strong>，仅 iPad Pro 11 英寸（第 4 代）与 12.9 英寸（第 6 代）支持（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uipencilinteraction\">Apple Pencil hover</a>）。</p>\n<p>Web 侧沿 Pointer Events 统一收口：<code>pointerType === &quot;pen&quot;</code> 时读 <code>pressure</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>）、<code>tiltX</code>/<code>tiltY</code>（度）、<code>twist</code>、<code>altitudeAngle</code>、<code>azimuthAngle</code>；笔杆按钮映射为 <code>button = 2</code>、橡皮端为 <code>button = 5</code>，任何 <code>pointerup</code> 的 <code>pressure</code> 恒为 0（<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/pointerevents3/\">W3C Pointer Events L3</a>）。\n延迟是笔迹体验的命门。<strong>降真延迟</strong>用 <code>View#requestUnbufferedDispatch()</code> 让输入系统立即投递事件，配合前缓冲渲染 <code>GLFrontBufferedRenderer</code>（<code>androidx.graphics:graphics-core:1.0.0-alpha03</code>，需 API 29+，只适合手写小区域，全屏缩放会撕裂）；<strong>降感知延迟</strong>用运动预测库 <code>androidx.input:input-motionprediction</code>（API 19+）的 <code>MotionEventPredictor.record()</code> / <code>predict()</code>，预测点仅作临时显示。防误触用 <code>ACTION_CANCEL</code>（API 1，系统手势与掌拒都会触发）与 <code>FLAG_CANCELED</code>（API 33，标记掌部或握持的意外触碰），收到后按 <code>pointerId</code> 撤销该笔画。</p>\n<h2 id=\"外接键盘-keyevent-焦点顺序与快捷键发现\">外接键盘：KeyEvent、焦点顺序与快捷键发现</h2><p>键盘是大屏上最被忽略的输入源——它决定「能不能不用手指走完流程」。Android 拦截硬件键用 <code>KeyEvent.Callback</code> 的 <code>onKeyDown()</code> / <code>onKeyUp()</code> / <code>onKeyMultiple()</code>，<code>Activity</code> 与 <code>View</code> 都实现了该接口。一处官方硬性警告必须记住：<strong>软键盘（IME）的按键事件不可依赖</strong>，<code>KeyEvent</code> 处理只应假定来自硬件键盘（<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/touch-and-input/keyboard-input/commands\">Handle keyboard actions</a>）。判断修饰键用 <code>event.isShiftPressed</code>、<code>event.isCtrlPressed</code>；只在按下瞬间触发一次用 <code>onKeyUp()</code>，长按重复触发才用 <code>onKeyDown()</code>。</p>\n<p>焦点顺序是键盘可用性的真正战场。框架内可交互控件（<code>Button</code>、<code>EditText</code>）默认可聚焦，但 Tab 顺序默认按布局声明序而非视觉序，在 <code>ConstraintLayout</code> 这类相对布局里几乎必然错位，必须显式声明：Tab 前进顺序用 <code>android:nextFocusForward</code>；方向键（D-pad）导航用 <code>android:nextFocusUp/Down/Left/Right</code> 覆盖框架的「最佳猜测」；<code>EditText</code> 会消费方向键用于光标移动而非移焦点；Compose 中对应 <code>Modifier.focusProperties()</code>。测试很具体：接蓝牙或 USB 键盘，<strong>只用 Tab 走一遍全 UI</strong> 确认焦点顺序，再从每个可聚焦元素出发用方向键走一遍（<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/touch-and-input/keyboard-input/navigation\">Support keyboard navigation</a>）。</p>\n<p>快捷键不该是隐藏技能，而应可被系统发现。Android 7.0（API 24）起提供「键盘快捷键助手」，用户按 <strong>Meta + <code>/</code></strong> 打开（Meta 键在 macOS 上是 Command、Windows 上是 Win 键、ChromeOS 上是搜索键）。应用覆写 <code>onProvideKeyboardShortcuts()</code>，添加 <code>KeyboardShortcutGroup</code> 与 <code>KeyboardShortcutInfo</code> 发布快捷键（<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/touch-input/keyboard-input/keyboard-shortcuts-helper\">Keyboard Shortcuts Helper</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"鼠标与触控板-hover-语义-间接指针与命中区\">鼠标与触控板：hover 语义、间接指针与命中区</h2><p>鼠标/触控板带来的最大增量是 <strong>hover</strong>——触点出现<strong>之前</strong>就能预告意图的状态。规范写法是先用触摸友好样式打底，再把 hover 增强关进能力查询里，绝不把关键内容只放在 hover 后面：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"button {&#10;  min-height: 44px;&#10;} /* 基线：触摸可用 */&#10;&#10;@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {&#10;  /* 精确且可 hover 的输入源 */&#10;  .menu-item:hover &gt; .submenu {&#10;    display: block;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;@media (any-pointer: coarse) {&#10;  button {&#10;    min-height: 44px;&#10;  }&#10;} /* 粗指针保底命中区 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  min-height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">44</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 基线：触摸可用 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@media</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pointer: fine) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 精确且可 hover 的输入源 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .menu-item:hover</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> .submenu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">block</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@media</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (any-pointer: coarse) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    min-height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">44</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 粗指针保底命中区 */</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Pointer Events 里 hover 由边界事件承载：<code>pointerover</code>/<code>pointerout</code> 冒泡，<code>pointerenter</code>/<code>pointerleave</code> 不冒泡且语义含后代节点。对支持 hover 的笔，边界事件在接触之前就会到达；对不支持 hover 的笔，它退化为触摸的事件序列（<code>pointerover → pointerenter → pointerdown → … → pointerup → pointerout → pointerleave</code>）。两个易踩细节：布局变化把元素移到静止未捕获的指针下方时也会触发边界事件，但静止指针<strong>不会</strong>收到 <code>pointermove</code>；命中区随能力切换时，MDN 示例用 <code>(any-pointer: fine)</code> 把复选框设成 15px、<code>(any-pointer: coarse)</code> 设成 30px，两者可<strong>同时</strong>匹配，靠声明先后决定胜负。</p>\n<p>平台侧，iOS 用 <code>.indirectPointer</code> 表示触控板/鼠标（iOS 13.4 起）并让 iPad 指针磁吸到控件；Android 从 7.0 起提供 Custom Pointer API 更换 hover 光标；Compose 用 <code>Modifier.hoverable(...)</code> 接收指针进出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条通道的对齐与验收\">三条通道的对齐与验收</h2><p>三种输入各自产生一套状态命名——触摸的 pressed、鼠标的 hovered、键盘的 focused——工程目标是让它们收敛到<strong>同一套可视反馈</strong>，否则用户会不确定「现在操作的是哪一个」。验收动作是把每个关键控件画成三条通道的交点：触摸通道要求 hit target 足够大（常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44</mn><mtext>px</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44\\text{px}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">px</span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为下限）、键盘通道要求 focusable 且 Tab 顺序正确、指针通道要求 hover 有预览且光标语义正确。任一条断掉，大屏上该功能就是实质缺失。Android 平板质量分级把这件事归到 Tier 2 增强外部输入支持与 Tier 1 差异化体验，测试矩阵要求覆盖折叠屏 841×701 dp、8 英寸平板 1024×640 dp、10.5 英寸平板 1280×800 dp、13 英寸 Chromebook 1600×900 dp（<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/docs/quality-guidelines/tablet-app-quality\">Android tablet app quality</a>）。三条通道的坐标与窗口宽度直接耦合：窗口变宽会重排控件，进而改变 Tab 顺序与 hover 命中区。窗口尺寸分级与断点见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../large-screen-ecosystem-window-model/window-size-class-breakpoint-model\">窗口尺寸分级与断点模型</a>；折叠设备的双面板布局与铰链避让会切分可聚焦区域，见 <a href=\"../foldable-posture-multiwindow-continuity/foldable-posture-hinge-model\">折叠姿态与铰链模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>抽象层次</strong>：输入源是能力集（<code>pointer</code>/<code>hover</code> 描述主源，<code>any-pointer</code>/<code>any-hover</code> 描述任意源），事件带真实来源（<code>pointerType</code> / <code>TOOL_TYPE_*</code> / <code>UITouch.type</code>）；CSS 无法区分笔与鼠标，只能靠事件里的 <code>pointerType === &quot;pen&quot;</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>笔</strong>：Android 读 <code>TOOL_TYPE_STYLUS/ERASER</code> 与压力、朝向、倾斜、<code>AXIS_DISTANCE</code>；iOS 用 <code>.pencil</code> + <code>altitudeAngle</code>/<code>azimuthAngle</code>，hover 由 <code>UIHoverGestureRecognizer.zOffset</code>（iOS 16.1，约 12 mm ≈ 34 points）承担；Web 走 Pointer Events 的 <code>pressure</code>/<code>tiltX/Y</code>，橡皮端 <code>button = 5</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>延迟与防误触</strong>：<code>requestUnbufferedDispatch()</code> + 前缓冲渲染（API 29+）降真延迟，运动预测库（API 19+）降感知延迟；<code>ACTION_CANCEL</code>（API 1）与 <code>FLAG_CANCELED</code>（API 33）按 <code>pointerId</code> 撤销笔画。</li>\n<li><strong>键盘与指针</strong>：<code>KeyEvent.Callback</code> 只应假定硬件键盘，Tab 顺序用 <code>nextFocusForward</code>、方向键用 <code>nextFocus*</code>，快捷键用 <code>onProvideKeyboardShortcuts()</code> 发布（Meta + <code>/</code>，API 24+）；hover 靠边界事件，静止指针不保证收到 <code>pointermove</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>验收标准</strong>：关键操作在触摸、键盘、指针三条通道上都必须可达；测试矩阵覆盖折叠屏与多尺寸平板的窗口宽度。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多模态输入模型：手写笔、外接键盘、鼠标与触控的焦点、hover 与快捷键","id":"多模态输入模型-手写笔-外接键盘-鼠标与触控的焦点-hover-与快捷键"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：输入源是「能力集」，不是「设备型号」","id":"核心概念-输入源是-能力集-不是-设备型号"},{"level":2,"text":"手写笔：工具类型、轴数据与 hover 距离","id":"手写笔-工具类型-轴数据与-hover-距离"},{"level":2,"text":"外接键盘：KeyEvent、焦点顺序与快捷键发现","id":"外接键盘-keyevent-焦点顺序与快捷键发现"},{"level":2,"text":"鼠标与触控板：hover 语义、间接指针与命中区","id":"鼠标与触控板-hover-语义-间接指针与命中区"},{"level":2,"text":"三条通道的对齐与验收","id":"三条通道的对齐与验收"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"姿态切换的异常与恢复：折叠展开中断、生命周期错乱与状态重建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/foldable-posture-multiwindow-continuity/posture-transition-state-recovery"},"next":{"title":"多设备测试矩阵：可调整窗口模拟、预览工具与自动化回归验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/multi-input-testing-store-quality-ops/testing-matrix-emulator-automation"}}